  "description": {

    "en": "Luxilon 4G Rough combines the legendary tension maintenance of the 4G family with a textured surface that enhances spin potential and ball bite. The dented surface increases string flex for a slightly softer feel while maintaining the outstanding stability, durability and control that define the 4G series. Engineered with strategically aligned molecular chains and Poly-Ether-Ether materials, 4G Rough minimizes tension loss over time and remains highly consistent even under demanding weather conditions.",

    "zh": "Luxilon 4G Rough 将 4G 系列著名的保磅能力与粗糙纹理表面相结合，进一步提升旋转能力和咬球表现。官方采用凹凸纹理（Dented Surface）设计，在增加球线弯曲能力的同时，带来比标准 4G 略微更加柔和的击球反馈，并保持 4G 系列优秀的稳定性、耐久性与控制力。特殊排列的高分子链结构（Strategically Aligned Molecular Chains）与 Poly-Ether-Ether 材料可显著降低张力衰减，即使在潮湿或恶劣天气条件下也能维持稳定表现。"
  },

